// REJECTS: Unexpected token '~groupBy'
//
// View modifier order is ~filter, ~groupBy, ~distinct. This has ~distinct before ~groupBy.
//
// The trap: on a relational CLASS MAPPING the order is the other way round -- ~filter,
// ~distinct, ~groupBy. Same two modifiers, same spelling, opposite order depending on
// which construct encloses them. A parser that shares one modifier-parsing routine between
// View and class mapping will accept both orders in both places.
###Relational
Database fixture::neg::ViewOrder
(
   Table T (ID VARCHAR(32) PRIMARY KEY, VAL VARCHAR(32))
   View V
   (
      ~distinct
      ~groupBy
      (
         T.VAL
      )
      id: T.ID PRIMARY KEY
   )
)
